==Swedish==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/soː/|lang=sv}}
* {{audio|Sv-så.ogg|audio}}

===Etymology 1===
From {{etyl|non|sv}} {{term|svá|lang=non}}, from {{proto|Germanic|swa|lang=sv}}.

====Adverb====
{{infl|sv|adverb}}

# [[so]], [[thus]], like that, in that way, in a certain manner
#: ''Är det inte '''så'''?''
#:: Isn't it so?
#: '''''så''' kallad''
#:: so called
#: '''''så''' det '''så'''!''
#:: so there!
# [[so]], [[that]], to that degree, to a certain extent
#: ''jag trodde inte den var '''så''' stor''
#:: I didn't think it was that big
#: ''den är '''så''' stor att inte får plats''
#:: it is so big that it doesn't fit
# [[how]], [[what]]
#: '''''så''' roligt!''
#:: how nice!
#: '''''så''' synd!''
#:: what a pity!
#: '''''så''' tråkigt!''
#:: how sad!
# [[then]], [[thereafter]]
#: ''se först åt vänster, '''så''' åt höger''
#:: first look left, then right
# {{slang|lang=sv}} [[so]]; [[very]] (???)

====Conjunction====
{{infl|sv|conjunction}}

# [[so]], [[that]]
#: '''''så''' att''
#:: so that
#: '''''så''' att inte''
#:: lest
#: ''det regnade, '''så''' vi satte oss inomhus''
#:: it rained, so we took a table indoors

====Pronoun====
{{infl|sv|pronoun}}

# [[so]], [[that]]
#: ''i '''så''' fall''
#:: if so, in that case

====See also====
* [[så gott som]]
* [[se så]]
* [[såhär]]

